  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Sustainable development of mountain regions</narrative>
  </title>
  <description type="1">
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Resolution of the Kyrgyz Republic &amp;quot;Sustainable Mountain Development&amp;quot; adopted at the 76th session of the UN General Assembly on December 16, 2021, proclaimed the years 2023-2027 as the &amp;quot;Five-Year Action Plan for the Development of Mountain Regions&amp;quot;. On July 19, 2023, the Kyrgyz Republic presented the global action plan for the implementation of the &amp;quot;Five Years of Action for the Development of Mountain Areas&amp;quot; at the UN headquarters in New York. As part of this plan, the National Commission and its partners, have planned various activities to promote sustainable development in mountain areas.</narrative>
  </description>
